---
import Preview from "./Preview.astro";
---

<section
  id="about"
  aria-label="about"
  class="lg:w-4/5 mx-auto scroll-mt-8 md:scroll-mt-12"
>
  <p>
    hey! i'm 19 from ottawa, canada<br />
    <br />
    currently, i'm...<br />
    - a first year student @ university of waterloo<br />
    - running programs & events @ <a href="https://hackclub.com" target="_blank"
      >hack club</a
    ><br />
    <br />
    i'm excited about...<br />
    - crafting code (i love ruby on rails)<br />
    - robotics, electronics & PCBs<br />
    - bringing people together<br />
    - silly adventures<br />
    - ???<br />
    <br />
    ---<br />
    <br />
    after graduating high school, i took a gap year with hack club in vermont, usa,
    building gamified software platforms and irl experiences that get teens to ship
    technical projects.<br />
    <br />
    a few things i've led @ hack club...<br />
    - <Preview href="https://youtu.be/dTGFOKblRc4"
      >7-day hardware hackathon</Preview
    > for 200 teens @ shenzhen, china (<a
      href="https://github.com/hackclub/fallout"
      target="_blank">repo</a
    >)<br />
    - <Preview href="https://blueprint.hackclub.com" img="/previews/blueprint.webp"
      >hardware grant program</Preview
    > with amd, reaching 25,000+ teens (<a
      href="https://github.com/hackclub/blueprint"
      target="_blank">repo</a
    >)<br />
    - <Preview href="https://youtu.be/esxk_nScxFQ"
      >ai & robotics hackathon</Preview
    > with amd, culminating <Preview href="https://youtu.be/28cWcxYd6Tk" img="/previews/ces.webp"
      >on-stage at CES</Preview
    ><br />
    - <Preview href="https://lookout.hackclub.com/" img="/previews/lookout.webp"
      >time-lapsing app</Preview
    >, tracking 60,000+ hours of work. (<a
      href="https://github.com/hackclub/lookout/"
      target="_blank">repo</a
    >)
  </p>
</section>
